    "tpc_book": "<div>\n<div>1.虛擬真實：沉浸式劇場創作祕笈</div>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/cat/all/key/Creating%20Worlds%3A%20How%20to%20Make%20Immersive%20Theatre\">Creating Worlds: How to Make Immersive Theatre</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<ul>\n\t<li>作者：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/key/%E5%82%91%E6%A3%AE%EF%BC%8E%E8%8F%AF%E5%80%AB/adv_author/1/\">傑森．華倫</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"javascript:setFollow('setFollowAuthorAjax','%E5%82%91%E6%A3%AE%EF%BC%8E%E8%8F%AF%E5%80%AB');\">追蹤作者</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.books.com.tw/activity/2015/06/trace/index.html#author\" target=\"_blank\">新功能介紹</a></li>\n\t<li>原文作者：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/key/Jason+Warren/adv_author/1/\">Jason Warren</a></li>\n\t<li>譯者：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/key/%E6%9D%9C%E7%A7%80%E5%A8%9F/adv_author/1/\">杜秀娟</a></li>\n\t<li>出版社：<a href=\"https://www.books.com.tw/web/sys_puballb/books/?pubid=bookman\">書林出版有限公司</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div>2.戲劇的世界：過程戲劇設計手冊\n<div>\n<div><a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/cat/all/key/Drama%20Worlds%3A%20A%20Framework%20for%20Process%20Drama\">Drama Worlds: A Framework for Process Drama</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<ul>\n\t<li>作者：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/key/%E8%A5%BF%E8%A5%BF%E8%8E%89%E2%80%A7%E6%AD%90%E5%B0%BC%E7%88%BE/adv_author/1/\">西西莉‧歐尼爾</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"javascript:setFollow('setFollowAuthorAjax','%E8%A5%BF%E8%A5%BF%E8%8E%89%E2%80%A7%E6%AD%90%E5%B0%BC%E7%88%BE');\">追蹤作者</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.books.com.tw/activity/2015/06/trace/index.html#author\" target=\"_blank\">新功能介紹</a></li>\n\t<li>原文作者：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/key/Cecily+O%E2%80%99Neill/adv_author/1/\">Cecily O&rsquo;Neill</a></li>\n\t<li>譯者：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://search.books.com.tw/search/query/key/%E6%AD%90%E6%80%A1%E9%9B%AF/adv_author/1/\">歐怡雯</a></li>\n\t<li>出版社：<a href=\"https://www.books.com.tw/web/sys_puba